## Part 4 — Scope: what this license does and does not cover

**The terms in Parts 1–3 cover only the original code, documentation, and
artistic assets that the copyright holder actually owns in this repository.**

They do **not** extend to any third-party material bundled with, or referenced
by, this project. Such material remains governed by its own upstream terms.

**The complete, verified inventory of third-party and generated content is in
[`THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md`](THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md). That file is a required
part of this license notice — do not separate it from this file when
redistributing.**

### 4.1 In summary

| Path / component | Owner | Covered by this file? |
|---|---|---|
| `src/**`, `build.rs`, `tools/**`, `scripts/**` | Copyright holder | **Yes** |
| `docs/**`, `README.md`, this file | Copyright holder | **Yes** |
| `assets/props/**` — generated by `tools/blender/*.py` | Copyright holder | **Yes** |
| `assets/soldier/soldier.glb` — generated by `tools/blender/build_soldier.py` | Copyright holder | **Yes** |
| `assets/maps/**` — hand-written TOML | Copyright holder | **Yes** |
| `assets/rt/**` — project-authored PT shaders | Copyright holder | **Yes** |
| `assets/*.spv` — produced at build time from in-repo WGSL | Copyright holder | **Yes** |
| `assets/guns/**`, `assets/guns_ext/**` — third-party models | **Their respective authors** | **No — see NOTICE** |
| `src/engine/cjk_glyphs.rs` — glyph bitmaps | ⚠️ **Derived from a system font; see NOTICE** | **No — see NOTICE** |
| Rust dependencies (10 crates) | Their respective authors | **No — see NOTICE** |

### 4.2 A note on the gun models

`assets/guns/` and `assets/guns_ext/` contain weapon models obtained from
third-party sources (originally Sketchfab and similar sites). **Each carries
its own license** — typically some variant of Creative Commons, but the
specific terms differ per asset and some variants forbid commercial use.

**Before redistributing this repository, or any build of it, you must verify
the license of every model in those directories individually.** Models whose
license does not permit redistribution — or does not permit the use you intend
— must be removed. `THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md` records what is currently known
about each one, including which entries are still unverified.

### 4.3 A note on the font-derived glyph data

`src/engine/cjk_glyphs.rs` contains bitmap glyphs extracted from a Microsoft
Windows system font. **This is flagged as the highest-risk item in the
repository and is explained in full in `THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md` §3.** If you
intend to redistribute this project, read that section first.

